implementationPlan.description:
Verification. This task changes the shared claim and wait scheduling path, so run the FULL daemon suite once: cd packages/moe-daemon && npm test.

Run it fresh. It must exit 0, and the command, exit code and output tail are the complete_task verification evidence.

On WSL the in-tree node_modules is Windows-native. Run the gate in a Linux snapshot, per mem gotcha-daemon-linux-snapshot-gate:
- git archive HEAD of the whole repo;
- overlay ONLY this task's five owned paths;
- symlink a native node_modules;
- run under env -i with a Linux-only PATH, so no MOE_* variable is set;
- cmp the owned files against the snapshot before citing the run.

Record pass and skip counts against the pre-change baseline. Any newly failing test is a regression: fix it. Never weaken it, skip it or loosen an existing assertion.

Also run the test-file typecheck the daemon gate uses (mem gotcha-daemon-tests-not-type-checked) on planReuseJob.test.ts.
